			"notes": "This release is pretty much functionally identical to 0.8.1, but the underlying function name of `World.getTime()` has changed, requiring a rebuild.  I've taken the opportunity to update the toolchain and Mixin Squared.\n\nVersion 0.9 supports 1.21.11 weeklies through 1.21.11.  After 1.21.11 I expect to migrate to Mojang's mappings, which may have some minor impacts on the API.\n\n- Update to Minecraft 25w46a\n- Update Mixin Squared to 0.3.3\n- Modernize HBE mixin slightly"
